      "text": "### 馆主资料 · 奇树（初战）\n单打；资料中的排列不保证AI固定出招顺序。\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "1",
    "eventId": 10,
    "type": "answer.delta",
    "sessionId": "077f37f0-0e7d-40fe-a42b-321925bc96e6",
